X86 rwc-fenced
"Transcribed from Owens, Sarkar, Sewell, A better x86 memory model: x86-TSO (extended version), Appendix A"
{  }
 P0         | P1          | P2          ;
 MOV [x],$1 | MOV EAX,[x] | MOV [y],$1  ;
            | MOV EBX,[y] | MFENCE      ;
            |             | MOV ECX,[x] ;
exists (1:EAX=1 /\ 1:EBX=0 /\ 2:ECX=0)
